  "historyNote": "#7012, eff 6-15-99; ss by #7912, eff 7-1-03; ss by #9902, eff 6-1-11; ss by #12782, INTERIM, eff 5-21-19, EXPIRED: 11-18-19 New. #12937, eff 12-7-19",
